        "liquid": "<style>\n  .usage-carousel {\n    display: flex;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    padding: 2rem 1rem;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n  }\n\n  .usage-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .usage-step {\n    flex: 0 0 80%;\n    max-width: 330px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    padding-bottom: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  .usage-step img {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-top-left-radius: 16px;\n    border-top-right-radius: 16px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    height: 220px;\n  }\n\n  .usage-step-content {\n    padding: 1.4rem;\n  }\n\n  .usage-step h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .usage-step p {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .usage-section-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-top: 2rem;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 992px) {\n    .usage-carousel {\n      justify-content: center;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n      flex-wrap: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .usage-step {\n      flex: 0 0 22%;\n      max-width: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<h2 class=\"usage-section-title\">Comment utiliser l’Accelerator Oil</h2>\n\n<div class=\"usage-carousel\">\n  <div class=\"usage-step\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/4787/6189/files/IMG_0972.webp?v=1749049771\" alt=\"Application\">\n    <div class=\"usage-step-content\">\n      <h3>💧 Application</h3>\n      <p>Déposez quelques gouttes sur un cuir chevelu propre et sec. Un gommage capillaire 2 fois par mois est recommandé.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"usage-step\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/4787/6189/files/IMG_0973.webp?v=1749049781\" alt=\"Massage crânien\">\n    <div class=\"usage-step-content\">\n      <h3>🤲 Massage</h3>\n      <p>Massez délicatement pour activer la microcirculation et optimiser la pénétration des actifs naturels.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"usage-step\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/4787/6189/files/IMG_0975.webp?v=1749049785\" alt=\"Temps de pose huile\">\n    <div class=\"usage-step-content\">\n      <h3>⏳ Temps de pose</h3>\n      <p>Laissez poser entre 3 et 5 heures pour une action renforcée sur la pousse et la structure du cheveu. Puis place au shampoing à pH 5 </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"usage-step\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/4787/6189/files/IMG_0974.webp?v=1749049795\" alt=\"Rinçage doux\">\n    <div class=\"usage-step-content\">\n      <h3>🫧 Rinçage</h3>\n      <p>Rincez à l’aide d’un shampoing doux. Une petite quantité suffit pour des résultats visibles dès les premières semaines.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
